# FROST ENGINE GAME SCRIPT
# Write your game in plain English!

# SETUP: Create the game world
game name: "My Awesome Game"
screen size: 1920 x 1080
background color: sky blue

# ENTITIES: Create game objects
player: is a box at position (0, 0, 0) with size (1, 2, 1), color red
ground: is a box at position (0, -1, 0) with size (20, 1, 20), color green
sun: is a light of type directional, color warm white, intensity 1.0

# Add some enemies
enemy type goblin: is a box at position (5, 0, 5) with size (1, 1, 1), color green, health 50
enemy type goblin: at position (-3, 0, 2) with health 50
enemy type dragon: is a box at position (10, 5, 10) with size (5, 5, 5), color purple, health 500

# CAMERA: Set up the player view
camera: follows player, type third person, distance 10 units behind

# PHYSICS: Enable physics
enable physics with gravity -9.8
player: has rigidbody, mass 70, can jump
goblin: has rigidbody, mass 30
ground: is static collider

# INPUT: Define controls
key "W": move player forward
key "A": move player left
key "S": move player backward
key "D": move player right
key "SPACE": make player jump
mouse: controls camera rotation

# GAME LOGIC:
# When player touches goblin, reduce goblin health by 10
# When goblin health is less than 0, destroy goblin

# When player health is less than 0, restart game
on enemy type dragon: attack player every 2 seconds, damage 20

# VISUAL EFFECTS:
add particle effect "fire" to dragon
add bloom with intensity 0.5

# SOUND:
play music "adventure.mp3"
when player jumps, play sound "jump.wav"
when goblin dies, play sound "enemy_death.wav"

# UI:
show score at top left
show health bar above player
show "Game Over" when player dies

# WIN CONDITION:
when all dragons are dead, show "VICTORY!"